# OWNERS — @nexora/domain-projects

## Bounded context

Projects (DOMAIN_MODEL.md DOM-05) — supporting domain, marketplace App.

## Ownership

- **Domain core:** the Project aggregate and its lifecycle. All business
  rules live here.
- **Application layer:** `@nexora/application-projects` (separate package,
  same team).
- **Persistence:** `packages/persistence` (`projects` table, migration 0004).
- **API + AI:** `apps/api` routes and the `CreateProjectTool` (delegate to the
  application layer — never to this package directly from infrastructure).

## Review rules

- Any lifecycle/state change must update this package, its tests, and
  `docs/LIFECYCLE.md` together.
- No new business rule may be enforced outside the domain (application/API/AI
  layers validate structure only).
